  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing Refugee Resettlement Assistance to the Government of Norway in 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to contribute to the provision of a durable solution to 1,400 persons in need of international protection in Jordan, Lebanon, Rwanda (Congolese and Eritreans and evacuees from Libya), Romania (evacuees from Libya), T&#xFC;rkiye and unidentified locations by facilitating their resettlement to Norway in 2024.</narrative>
  </description>
